### RCY
### The SAI creates the internal recycle port from sai_recycle_port_lane_base
### (as the Broadcom J2C+ VOQ reference does). Do NOT also map it to an explicit
### logical ucode_port: doing so (ucode_port_49 -> RCY0) exposes it as a discoverable
### port and syncd's collectPortRelatedObjects aborts because the recycle port
### does not support SAI_PORT_ATTR_QOS_* list attributes (attr 27 NOT_SUPPORTED).
sai_recycle_port_lane_base=200

